  "name": "Destined Rivals Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Destined Rivals prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 17–18 and 24–25 May 2025, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Destined Rivals booster packs, a code card and one of four 40-card decks, each built around a copy of one of the set's own cards with the Destined Rivals logo on the picture: a holofoil Ethan's Typhlosion, Misty's Gyarados or Team Rocket's Tyranitar, or a cosmos holofoil Team Rocket's Mimikyu. The decks also held non-holo copies of Ethan's Typhlosion, Misty's Gyarados and Team Rocket's Tyranitar, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Scarlet & Violet TCG Series merchandise, Destined Rivals Build & Battle Box",
